HeavyX — Heavy Machinery Detection & PTZ Follow

Based on DetectX by Fred Juhlin (https://github.com/pandosme/DetectX), MIT
license — see app/LICENSE. PTZ follow logic derived from the steerx ACAP in
this repository (MIT).

The bundled model weights (app/model/model.tflite) are derived from YOLOv5
(Ultralytics, AGPL-3.0) fine-tuned on public construction datasets. The
weights license is independent of the source license: review AGPL obligations
before any commercial redistribution of this package.
